WEBVTT

00:04:58.613 --> 00:05:01.771
But can we really do this
on a global scale?

00:05:02.081 --> 00:05:05.095
One billion children a year
experiencing violence.

00:05:05.119 --> 00:05:06.404
I think we can.

00:05:06.428 --> 00:05:10.770
In 2015, 193 world leaders
committed their countries

00:05:10.794 --> 00:05:13.602
to end violence, abuse
and neglect of children by 2030.

00:05:14.204 --> 00:05:15.570
Violence against children

00:05:15.594 --> 00:05:17.705
undermines all the other
investments in them:

00:05:17.729 --> 00:05:19.815
in their health, in their education.

00:05:19.839 --> 00:05:21.014
Often with multi-year,

00:05:21.038 --> 00:05:26.004
sometimes lifelong and intergenerational
consequences and transmission.

00:05:26.831 --> 00:05:29.895
But it's not just about
international agreements and governments.

00:05:29.919 --> 00:05:31.093
They really matter.